error[RB0317]: `pin` is sensitive, and field `value` of `Box` is not
  --> RB0317-sensitive-generic-field.road:12:32
   |
12 |     entry do show(Box { value: pin }), keep(Box { value: pin }), show(Secret { value: pin })
   |                                ^^^ a trace would show this value
   |
   = help: traces redact only what is marked: mark field `value` of `Box` `sensitive` too, or derive what may be shown with a `fn`

