error[RB0318]: `Secret<int>` has sensitive fields, and argument `v` of `show` is `json`
  --> RB0317-sensitive-generic-field.road:12:71
   |
12 |     entry do show(Box { value: pin }), keep(Box { value: pin }), show(Secret { value: pin })
   |                                                                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a trace would show these fields
   |
   = help: traces redact a value by its type, and `json` has no fields to redact by: give parameter `v` of `show` the value's own type, or mark it `sensitive`
